"Add and Remove run the same actions as /cs <level> add <nick> and /cs "
"<level> del <nick>."
msgstr ""
"Ajouter et supprimer exécuter les mêmes actions que /cs <level> ajouter "
"<nick> et /cs <level> del <nick>."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/chanserv_access.html.heex:42
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "All write actions require NickServ identification."
msgstr ""
"Toutes les actions d'écriture nécessitent une identification NickServ."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/channel_welcome_message.html.heex:22
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Applies only to the current channel"
msgstr "S'applique uniquement au canal actuel"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/chanserv_register.html.heex:46
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "ChanServ Access Lists"
msgstr "Listes d'accès ChanServ"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/chanserv_access.html.heex:2
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"ChanServ access lists grant persistent channel privileges to identified "
"users when they join a registered channel."
msgstr ""
"Les listes d'accès ChanServ accordent des privilèges de canaux persistants "
"aux utilisateurs identifiés lorsqu'ils rejoignent un canal enregistré."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/chanserv_register.html.heex:2
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"ChanServ registration assigns a founder to the current channel and keeps "
"channel ownership, access lists, bans, and settings available after the "
"channel empties or restarts."
msgstr ""
"L'enregistrement ChanServ assigne un fondateur au canal actuel et maintient "
"la propriété du canal, les listes d'accès, les interdictions et les "
"paramètres disponibles après que le canal se vide ou redémarre."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/channel_transfer_ownership.html.heex:8
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/channel_transfer_ownership.html.heex:40
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/channel_welcome_message.html.heex:8
